    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674300/extras/b3daa6aeea63b10c1fa8a3ef0f7c36b5.webp?t=1752794593\" /></div> <strong>Ablockalypse: A Classic Reignited</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to put your spatial reasoning and quick-thinking skills to the ultimate test? <strong>Ablockalypse</strong> takes the timeless puzzle gameplay you love and supercharges it with a fast-paced, action-packed twist that will keep you coming back for more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race against the clock to fit the falling pieces into place, clearing as many lines as possible before the screen fills up. With each passing level, the game speeds up, pushing your reflexes and strategy to their limits. Do you have what it takes to conquer all 9 levels of increasing difficulty and achieve the ultimate high score?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674300/extras/b3daa6aeea63b10c1fa8a3ef0f7c36b5.webp?t=1752794593\" /></div> <strong>Why You'll Love Ablockalypse</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Addictive Gameplay:</strong> The perfect blend of challenge and fun, designed to keep you hooked.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Custom Engine Built for Quality:</strong> Every detail has been crafted for smooth, responsive gameplay that feels as satisfying as it is challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Replayability Galore:</strong> Chase your personal best, set new high scores, or share the experience with friends in competitive pass-and-play sessions.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674300/extras/b3daa6aeea63b10c1fa8a3ef0f7c36b5.webp?t=1752794593\" /></div> <strong>Early Access Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this Early Access release, you\u2019ll find:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first <strong>9 levels</strong> of pulse-pounding action, each ramping up the challenge to keep you on your toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A foundation built with care and precision to ensure an enjoyable, polished experience even at this stage of development.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change the size of the playing board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Score combos by completing a line multiple turns in a row.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grid Guide to ensure blocks are placed perfectly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674300/extras/000ba073a4b59a8aa8edb9d05e1d625e.poster.avif?t=1752794593\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674300/extras/000ba073a4b59a8aa8edb9d05e1d625e.webm?t=1752794593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674300/extras/db6aa24c92d241effa69e3585d51d556.avif?t=1752794593\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674300/extras/b3daa6aeea63b10c1fa8a3ef0f7c36b5.webp?t=1752794593\" /></div> <strong>What\u2019s Next?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is just the beginning. We\u2019re actively working to expand and enhance <strong>Ablockalypse</strong> with new features, levels, and surprises based on community feedback. Your support and input will shape the future of the game, helping us deliver the ultimate tetromino experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you for joining us on this exciting journey. Whether you\u2019re aiming for the top of the leaderboard or simply enjoying a nostalgic yet modern twist, <strong>Ablockalypse</strong> promises endless hours of engaging fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Download now and let the challenge begin!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674300/extras/b3daa6aeea63b10c1fa8a3ef0f7c36b5.webp?t=1752794593\" /></div> <strong>Ablockalypse: A Classic Reignited</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to put your spatial reasoning and quick-thinking skills to the ultimate test? <strong>Ablockalypse</strong> takes the timeless puzzle gameplay you love and supercharges it with a fast-paced, action-packed twist that will keep you coming back for more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race against the clock to fit the falling pieces into place, clearing as many lines as possible before the screen fills up. With each passing level, the game speeds up, pushing your reflexes and strategy to their limits. Do you have what it takes to conquer all 9 levels of increasing difficulty and achieve the ultimate high score?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674300/extras/b3daa6aeea63b10c1fa8a3ef0f7c36b5.webp?t=1752794593\" /></div> <strong>Why You'll Love Ablockalypse</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Addictive Gameplay:</strong> The perfect blend of challenge and fun, designed to keep you hooked.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Custom Engine Built for Quality:</strong> Every detail has been crafted for smooth, responsive gameplay that feels as satisfying as it is challenging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Replayability Galore:</strong> Chase your personal best, set new high scores, or share the experience with friends in competitive pass-and-play sessions.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674300/extras/b3daa6aeea63b10c1fa8a3ef0f7c36b5.webp?t=1752794593\" /></div> <strong>Early Access Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this Early Access release, you\u2019ll find:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The first <strong>9 levels</strong> of pulse-pounding action, each ramping up the challenge to keep you on your toes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A foundation built with care and precision to ensure an enjoyable, polished experience even at this stage of development.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change the size of the playing board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Score combos by completing a line multiple turns in a row.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grid Guide to ensure blocks are placed perfectly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674300/extras/000ba073a4b59a8aa8edb9d05e1d625e.poster.avif?t=1752794593\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674300/extras/000ba073a4b59a8aa8edb9d05e1d625e.webm?t=1752794593\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674300/extras/db6aa24c92d241effa69e3585d51d556.avif?t=1752794593\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1674300/extras/b3daa6aeea63b10c1fa8a3ef0f7c36b5.webp?t=1752794593\" /></div> <strong>What\u2019s Next?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is just the beginning. We\u2019re actively working to expand and enhance <strong>Ablockalypse</strong> with new features, levels, and surprises based on community feedback. Your support and input will shape the future of the game, helping us deliver the ultimate tetromino experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you for joining us on this exciting journey. Whether you\u2019re aiming for the top of the leaderboard or simply enjoying a nostalgic yet modern twist, <strong>Ablockalypse</strong> promises endless hours of engaging fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Download now and let the challenge begin!</strong></p>",
